Current workflow:
- Download the query .jsons if missing in data/queries
- Run extract_random to pull out 10 random entries per query.
	- Generates .csv saving ID, PATH, CAPTION, QUERYID
	- Saves to data/random_samples.csv
- Run download_images to automatically download images from the extracted entries
	- Saved images go to data/images
- Run generate_embeddings to process the images and captions in the current .csv
	- Embeddings save to embeddings/random_samples
- Run verify_embeddings to analyze the results.
	- Verification report saves to embeddings/random_samples/similarity_report.csv
	- Caption specific reporting saves to embeddings/random_samples/caption_rank_report.csv



